Third-party parts
-----------------

The following parts are not covered by the notice above. Each stays under its
own license, whose terms and credits continue to apply:

- The word lists in wordlist/lists/ (secret, guess and banned words) are
  created from the English Speller Database (ESDB, formerly SCOWL), Copyright
  2000-2026 by Kevin Atkinson, whose main sources are Alan Beale's 12dicts and
  ENABLE2K. Its license notice is in wordlist/NOTICE-ESDB.
- The definitions in wordlist/lists/definitions.json are adapted from Open
  English WordNet (2025 edition), licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0). See wordlist/NOTICE-OEWN.
- The bundled fonts Rubik and JetBrains Mono (via Fontsource) are under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Preact and the other npm packages the app and server are built with are
  under their own licenses, as listed in package-lock.json and each package.
